 "text": "Assessor's Office / Hendricks County, Indiana\nSkip over navigation\nHendricks County, Indiana\nSearch\nSubmit\nMenu\nDepartments  Boards & Commissions  Administrative & Plat Committee\nBoard of Health\nBoard of Zoning Appeals\nDrainage Board\nPlan Commission\nPublic Defender Board\nRedevelopment Authority\nRedevelopment Commission\nCounty Commissioners  Commissioner Meeting Agendas\nCommissioner Meeting Minutes\nCommissioner Meeting Schedule\nCounty Council  Council Meeting Agendas\nCouncil Meeting Minutes\nCouncil Meeting Schedule\nCounty Officials  Assessors Office\nAuditors Office\nCounty Clerk\nProsecutor\nRecorders Office\nSheriffs Office\nSurveyors Office\nTreasurers Office\nCounty Departments A-M  Animal Shelter\nAssessors Office\nAuditors Office\nChief Public Defender's Office\nClean Water\nComputer Center\nCoroner\nCounty Clerk\nCounty Courts\nCounty Museum\nCypress Manor\nEmergency Management\nEngineering\nFacilities\nHealth Department\nHighway\nHuman Resources  Job Postings\nCounty Departments N-Z  Parks & Recreation\nPlanning & Building\nProbation\nProsecutor\nPurdue Extension\nRecorders Office\nRegional Sewer District\nSheriffs Office\nSurveyors Office\nTreasurers Office\nVeterans Administration\nVoter Registration\nWork Release Facility\nJustice System  Child Support Division\nCounty Clerk\nCounty Courts\nProbation\nProsecutor's Office\nSheriff's Department\nWork Release Facility\nFairgrounds Complex\nHendricks County Recycling District\nStaff Directory\nSoil & Water Conservation District\nResidents  Browse County Photos\nBrowse County Services\nFind A Document  County News\nForms & Applications\nMeeting Agendas\nMeeting Minutes\nUseful Links\nFind A Location\nSubmit An Online Form\nView County Events\nRegister For eNotifications\nTaxes  Property Lookup\nAssessors Office\nAuditor's Office\nTreasurer's Office\nArchives\nHow Do I...  Browse the County Staff\nFind an Event\nFind a Location\nFind a Service\nSubmit a Request\nView FAQs\nView a Slideshow\nVisit the Meeting Center\nFind a Document  Agendas\nBreaking News\nForms & Applications\nMinutes\nNews & Notices\nUseful Links\nStart Content\nAssessor's Office\nHome\nDepartments\nAssessor's Office\nThe primary function of the Assessor's office is to assess the value of real and personal property. Property taxes in Indiana are collected by the local county treasurers, based on assessments that are provided by the township and county assessors. These assessments are based on guidelines and regulations set forth by state legislators and adopted by the Indiana Department of Local Government Finance.\nPlease visit https://engage.xsoftinc.com/hendricks to find property record cards, mapping, tax, appeals, personal property, mobile home, and other information.\nNews\nLinks\nNews\nNotice to Bidders for a Professional Appraiser to act as Technical Advisor Regarding Real Property Reassessment for County Assessor\nProperty Tax Assessment Appeals Fact Sheet\nProperty Tax Caps/ Circuit Breaker Credits\nAnnual Adjustment of Assessed Values\nStatewide Cyclical Reassessment Fact Sheet\nMore News\nLinks\nReassessment Questionnaire\nForm 135 - Affidavit of Destroyed or Removed Property\nIndiana Department of Local Government Finance\nDepartment of Local Government Finance (DGLF) Fact Sheet About Tax Deductions & Credits\nUSDA Aerial Info\nMore Links\nContact Us\nNicole Lawson ,\nAssessor\nAssessor's Office\n355 S Washington St\n#230\nDanville, IN 46122 Get Directions\nPhone: (317) 745-9207\nFax: (317) 745-9411\nEmail Us\nStaff Directory\nHours: M - F 8:00 a.m. - 4:00 p.m.\nExcept for Holidays\nIn this Department\nFAQ\nForms\nAnnual Adjustment\nSales Disclosure\nPersonal Property\nAppeals\nCyclical Reassessment\nJump to a division Make a Selection FAQ Forms Annual Adjustment Sales Disclosure Personal Property Appeals Cyclical Reassessment Section Home\nTopics of Interest\nAg Rate\nLand Classification\nRentals\nDisaster Relief\nJump to a topic or subtopic Make 